'''Sumacàrcer''' ({{Literal translation|enclosed place on the hill}}; {{Lang-arn|Pangipülli|lit=place of the {{W|puma}}s}}) is a city in [[Cadaqués]], and the ?th-most populous city in [[Cerdanya]] with a recorded population of 88,628 in the [[2025 Baliscan census]]. It serves as a [[W:Commuter town|commuter town]] for [[Concepción]], to the east, and forms part of the [[Megaregions of Balisca|urban agglomeration]] known as ''[[Mercepción]]''.

